# #1074 — what this workspace does not keep.
#
# `ios/` and `android/` are **in** the repository (the ticket's own scope), and
# each carries the `.gitignore` Capacitor generates for its own build output
# (`ios/.gitignore`, `android/.gitignore`), so this file only adds what those
# two do not cover.

.env

# Firebase config per app profile (`profiles/<id>/`): given to a build, never
# committed, and copied into the native project by `npm run profile:apply`.
profiles/*/google-services.json
profiles/*/GoogleService-Info.plist

# …and the copies it writes.
ios/App/App/GoogleService-Info.plist
android/app/google-services.json
